{title: To God Be the Glory (Praise the Lord)}
{artist: Fanny J. Crosby, William Howard Doane, C. Michael Pilato}
{time: 3/4}

Verse 1
[G#]To God be the [D#7]glory; great things He hath [G#]done.
So loved He [D#]the world that He [D#7]gave us His Son,
Who [D#]yielded His life an [G#]atonement for sin
And [C#]opened the lifegate that all [G#]may go in.

Chorus
Praise [A#]the Lord!  Let the [A#7]earth hear His voice!
Praise [D#]the Lord!  Let the [D#7]people rejoice!
Praise the [G#]Lord!  Let the earth hear [D#7]His voice!
Praise the [G#]Lord!

Verse 2
O perfect redemption, [D#]the purchase of blood.
To [G#]every believer, the promise [G#7]of God:
The vilest [A#m]offender who truly believes,
That [G#]moment from Jesus a [D#]pardon receives.

Chorus
Praise the [G#]Lord!  Let the earth hear [D#7]His voice!
Praise the [G#]Lord!  Let the people [D#]rejoice!
Praise the Lord!  [G#]Let the earth hear His [D#]voice!
Praise the Lord!

Verse 3
[G#]O come to the [D#7]Father
Through Jesus Christ the [D#]Son!
O come to [G#]the Father
Through Jesus [D#7]Christ the Son!

Verse 4
Great things [G#]He hath taught us; [D#7]great things He hath [G#]done.
And great our rejoicing [D#7]through Jesus the Son.
[G#]But purer and higher [D#7]and greater will be
Our [G#]wonder — our vict'ry [D#]— when Jesus we [G#]see!

Verse 5
Praise the Lord!  Let [G#7]the earth hear His [A#m]voice!
Praise the Lord!  [G#]Let the people rejoice!
Praise [D#]the Lord!  Let the [G#]earth hear His voice!
